         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Climate and Dynamics; CRYOSPHERE: Glaciers, Snow, Ice, Glaciology; HISTORY OF GEOPHYSICS: Cryosphere; HYDROLOGY: Snow and ice, Glaciology; ATMOSPHERIC PROCESSES: Boundary layer processes</rdf:li>
